mpt to solve each equation in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3w+2 & =2w+2 \\\\ 3w+2-2w-2 & =2w+2-2w-2 \\\\ w & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $3w+2=2w+2$ has the unique solution $w=0.$\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4w-7 & =4w-7 \\\\ 4w-7-4w & =4w-7-4w \\\\ -7 & =-7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is true for all values of $w.$\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6w+5 & =6w+9 \\\\ 6w+5-6w & =6w+9-6w \\\\ 5 & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $w.$ Therefore, the equation $6w+5=6w+9$ has no solutions.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-288073/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-288073"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-288070/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "dddd2ac9-fd00-5018-91f7-c30dc727cdbd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-288070/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "f0dacd0f-b074-5fc6-866e-77c81600fa49" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-288070/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "d0cc680e-3862-5741-a6ba-91aa86abef8b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-288070/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "6621e02e-818e-5ffd-aad1-abbc6bdb2482" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-288070/selection/1e5815fe88f764dcffb6e1d4884bd91ce2c23cb2e4c57c2f2f99b70378aa1f23" :answer/id #uuid "c708be9e-ad93-519a-a3ec-fe6426e02b11" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-288070/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c12deb50-4da8-53eb-9edf-73092abbf67c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-288070/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer-field/choices ["q-288070/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" "q-288070/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-288070/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" "q-288070/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" "q-288070/selection/1e5815fe88f764dcffb6e1d4884bd91ce2c23cb2e4c57c2f2f99b70378aa1f23"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-288070" :question/id #uuid "f5a6b09f-75cb-52e3-a292-011882596ba1" :question/math-academy-id "q-288070" :question/problem "Which of the following equations has no solutions?\n\n- $-4y+2=-4y-5$\n- $6y+3=6y-1$\n- $5y-7=2y+1$" :question/worked-solution "Let's attempt to solve each equation in turn:\n\n- For the first equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-4y+2 & =-4y-5 \\\\ -4y+2+4y & =-4y-5+4y \\\\ 2 & =-5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $y.$ Therefore, the equation $-4y+2=-4y-5$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6y+3 & =6y-1 \\\\ 6y+3-6y & =6y-1-6y \\\\ 3 & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis equation is false for all values of $y.$ Therefore, the equation $6y+3=6y-1$ has no solutions.\n\n- For the third equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5y-7 & =2y+1 \\\\ 5y-7-2y+7 & =2y+1-2y+7 \\\\ 3y & =8 \\\\ y & =\\frac{8}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation $5y-7=2y+1$ has the unique solution $y=\\frac{8}{3}.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-288070/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d6226fdb-ee73-5a78-87d5-9d6a988a9eb4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-288070"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-288144/selection/c7e2c99672184a6ffc5fe21255ac37862a4c27e4b225c7b645ba47d8f3c76eda" :answer/id #uuid "3e5e61ef-b29c-5f19-898f-57ee3b98e087" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-288144/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "f28f3b67-3822-51ec-8ab2-51729b671cad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-288144/selection/5b6a7457ecf38e757655a8ab80cd7dca24376644ed8b5d929a23fb6af65f88f0" :answer/id #uuid "017d2336-5c59-523b-ba15-5ef9d7e3b88a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{9}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-288144/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "422f0c92-53fe-51bb-9892-289721abbb4a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-288144/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "2366889c-af5d-5743-8e6d-161f4a222a77" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-288144/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a71de821-baaf-5ed2-a1d9-25db8737a220" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-288144/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer-field/choices ["q-288144/selection/c7e2c99672184a6ffc5fe21255ac37862a4c27e4b225c7b645ba47d8f3c76eda" "q-288144/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" "q-288144/selection/5b6a7457ecf38e757655a8ab80cd7dca24376644ed8b5d929a23fb6af65f88f0" "q-288144/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" "q-288144/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-288144" :question/id #uuid "d9d87fe6-b6e0-5ddd-bc49-0e873da45bf9" :question/math-academy-id "q-288144" :question/problem "Consider the equation in the variable $z,$ given by\n\n$$\n-5(p-9)z=10\n$$\n\nwhere $p$ is a constant. Given that this equation has no solution, what is the value of $p?$" :question/worked-solution "Suppose we have an equation of the form\n\n$$\nax=b\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ and $b$ are constants, and $b\\ne 0.$ If $a=0,$ then the equation has no solution.\n\nNotice that this equation is in the form $az=b.$ In this case, \n\n$$\na=-5(p-9),\\,b=10.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equation has no solution if\n\n$$\n-5(p-9)=0.\n$$\n\nSolving this for $p,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-5(p-9) & =0 \\\\ \\frac{-5(p-9)}{-5} & =\\frac{0}{-5} \\\\ p-9 & =0 \\\\ p & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-288144/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c0e7426e-553d-5f20-811f-15f3a5ea0056"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-288144"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-288596/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "c0f277d2-9e6f-52d6-b109-0df2021c60a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-288596/selection/f853eeffac47c628af4a2b7e7b0ecd024652f548b0b0007bc18dba21ad82ad7c" :answer/id #uuid "6b15d697-6be4-5e0f-bfca-6a35d0a2ff3e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-288596/selection/e3b46c3e63ee8ef5a071cd8ef5f7250114c0c6983477af061861d82a06039d46" :answer/id #uuid "3ef0d44e-2bb6-53df-b130-55819d6b5206" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{9}"